OL,3,GNEWSAFarewell to cross-Channel ferry
OL,4,Aafter three decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FListen back to BBC Radio Solent for
OL,7,FDorset as Brittany Ferries' Barfleur
OL,8,Fsails out of Poole for the final time
OL,10,FThe operator has blamed high costs and
OL,11,Ffalling passenger numbers for the
OL,12,Fdecision to end the 34-year route to
OL,13,FCherbourg and sell the vessel
OL,15,FPeople gathered on the shoreline and on
OL,16,Fsmall boats to say farewell
OL,18,FThe ferry cast off its moorings at
OL,19,FPoole's ferry terminal a few minutes
OL,20,Fafter its 08:30 BST scheduled departure
OL,21,Ftime
